  "steps": [
    "Boil soya chunks with salt and ginger-garlic paste for 5–7 minutes. Drain, rinse and squeeze out excess water.",
    "Mix Greek yogurt, cream, cheese, cornflour, garam masala, black pepper and salt. Add boiled soya chunks and mix well.",
    "Air-fry at 180°C for 12–15 minutes, shaking halfway.",
    "For the sauce, sauté garlic in butter. Add chilli flakes and cornflour, mix, then add water and stir until smooth.",
    "Add fresh cream and coriander. Mix well.",
    "Pour the creamy garlic sauce over the air-fried soya chunks and serve."
  ],
